==================== Input ====================
// A `//` on a comma's line stays on that line (DIVERGENCES.md "line-comment-after-comma").
@list: #aaaaaa, // Start with A
  #bbbbbb, // then some B
  #cccccc; // and round it out with C
a {
  transition: a 1s, // c
    b 2s;
  b: f(a, // c
    b);
}

